<title>HONDURAS: Honduras coffee exports 81 pct complete in cycle.</title>
<headline>Honduras coffee exports 81 pct complete in cycle.</headline>
<dateline>TEGUCIGALPA, Honduras 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honduras has exported 81 percent of its exportable coffee output in the current 1996-1997 cycle, according to a report from Honduran Coffee Institute released Tuesday.</p>
<p>To May 15, Honduras exported 2.1 million 46-kg bags of coffee of a forecast production of 2.6 million exportable quintals, the report said. It added that domestic consumption this cycle totaled 219,032 bags to the date.</p>
<p>The exports are up 90,451 bags on the previous cycle to the same date, an increase of 4.6 percent, the report said.</p>
<p>((--Tegucigalpa bureau +504 327898))</p>
